+npm run retention:run
+```
+
+Execucao manual limitada a um tenant especifico, quando necessario:
+
+```bash
+cd /opt/re7online/site-re7online/apps/whatsapp-agent
+npm run retention:run -- --client-key justa-advocacia
+```
