+```cron
+30 3 * * * cd /opt/re7online/site-re7online/apps/whatsapp-agent && npm run retention:run >> /opt/re7online/site-re7online/apps/whatsapp-agent/.data/logs/retention-global.log 2>&1
+```
+
+Verificacao:
+
+```bash
+crontab -l | grep retention
